<measure n="7"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n13" pname="f" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>這</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>擔</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n14" pname="e" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>樣</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>我</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n15" pname="d" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>快</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>罪</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">G7</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="8"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n16" pname="c" oct="4" dur="2" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>活？</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>辜，</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">Cm</harm>
</measure>
<sb/>
<measure n="9"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n17" pname="c" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>為</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>藉</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n18" pname="e" oct="4" dur="4"/>
<note xml:id="n19" pname="g" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>何</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>祂</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">Cm</harm>
<slur startid="#n17" endid="#n18"/>
</measure>
<measure n="10"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n20" pname="c" oct="5" dur="2">
<verse n="1"><syl>喜</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>十</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n21" pname="c" oct="5" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>樂</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>架，</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
</measure>
<measure n="11"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n22" pname="e" oct="5" dur="4" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>常</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>我</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n23" pname="d" oct="5" dur="8">
<verse n="1"><syl>顯</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>蒙</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n24" pname="c" oct="5" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>你</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>救</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">A♭</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="12"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n25" pname="g" oct="4" dur="2" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>面，</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>贖；</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">Cm</harm>
</measure>
<sb/>
<measure n="13"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n26" pname="b" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>似</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>所</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n27" pname="a" oct="4" dur="4"/>
<note xml:id="n28" pname="f" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>有</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>有</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">Fm</harm>
<slur startid="#n26" endid="#n27"/>
</measure>
<measure n="14"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n29" pname="d" oct="4" dur="2">
<verse n="1"><syl>活</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>罪</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n30" pname="d" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>泉</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>過</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">G7</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="15"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n31" pname="f" oct="4" dur="4" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>湧</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>祂</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n32" pname="e" oct="4" dur="8">
<verse n="1"><syl>自</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>血</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n33" pname="d" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>你</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>盡</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
</measure>
<measure n="16" right="end"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n34" pname="c" oct="4" dur="2" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>懷。</syl></verse><verse n="2"><syl>除。</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">Cm</harm>
</measure>
</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>（問）</l><l>我的朋友，再告訴我，</l><l>是否你的就是這些？</l><l>即或我罪都洗清潔，</l><l>我的生活仍有所需。</l><l>（答）</l><l>哦，這恩主何其豐厚，</l><l>豈是數語就能說盡，</l><l>祂已復活作我生命，</l><l>成為我的能力，供應。</l><l>（同啍）</l><l>啦…………（一遍）</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>（問）</l><l>我是希奇你所得著，</l><l>罪已赦免，生命裡活，</l><l>但我不知像我這樣，</l><l>祂的救恩能否得著？</l><l>（答）</l><l>哦，願你能知祂大愛，</l><l>祂需要你，祂手伸出，</l><l>祂巴不得賜你救贖，</l><l>作你生命，作你救主。</l><l>（同啍）</l><l>啦…………（一遍）</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>（問）</l><l>朋友，朋友，</l><l>我今敞開我的心門</l><l>讓祂進來，</l><l>但願赦罪、生命、能力、</l><l>喜樂活水湧自我懷。</l><l>（答）</l><l>弟兄，弟兄，我們同來，</l><l>享受救主，就是現在，</l><l>我們同是蒙恩罪人，</l><l>讚祂恩惠，頌祂大愛。</l><l>（同啍）</l><l>啦…………（一遍）</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
